      "title": "The 1912 emblem",
      "blurb": "The mark as it was printed in the Bend Bulletin on 3 July 1912, the earliest publication of it this project has found. A double ring, hand-composed letters, heavier strokes. Reconstructed from that page; the record of what was and was not changed is in the archive.",
